<div class="section_content content" id="10617716_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">The City of Albany may require any person undertaking activities regulated by this article to pay reasonable costs at prevailing rates for review of SWPPPs, inspections or SMP maintenance performed by City personnel or performed by a third party for the City of Albany.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
      </div>
